---
// The small mark before the site name in the top bar (Mark under TopBar in COMPONENTS.md): the
// hero's infinity sign, drawn in the same face and weight, in the accent. Decorative: the site
// name beside it is the name, so it is hidden from assistive tech. accent-text on paper, and
// accent-bright on the dark bar, should the top bar ever turn dark.
---

<svg class="site-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <text x="12" y="10.8" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" font-size="27" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-weight="700">&#8734;</text>
</svg>

<style>
  /* The name hangs beside the mark when it wraps on a phone. */
  :global(*:has(> .site-mark)) {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .site-mark {
    flex: none;
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.125rem; /* centred on the first 1.5rem line */
    fill: var(--accent-text);
  }
  :global(html[data-menu='open']) .site-mark,
  :global(html[data-drawer-open]) .site-mark {
    fill: var(--accent-bright);
  }
</style>
